    ],
    "text": "Austin Group Defects 411 and 1318 are applied, adding [I106]accept4[/I106](), requiring FD_CLOEXEC and FD_CLOFORK to be clear for the\nfile descriptor returned by [I107]accept[/I107](), and clarifying the requirements for O_NONBLOCK on the file description created by\n[I108]accept[/I108]().",
